CSV Profiler
A Python-based tool designed to analyze CSV files, perform data profiling, and generate automated reports via CLI or a Graphical User Interface.

## Setup
Follow these steps to get your development environment ready:

Create a Virtual Environment:
python -m venv .venv

## Run CLI
To process a CSV file and generate a report directly from your terminal, use the following command:

Bash
python main.py data/sample.csv

# Run GUI
If you prefer a visual interface to interact with your data, run the application using:

Bash
streamlit run src/csv_profiler/app.py

## Output Files
report.json
report.md

##Project Structure

src/csv_profiler/: Core logic including profiling.py and render.py.

data/: Place your input CSV files here.

outputs/: Where your generated reports will appear.